Subject: [PATCH 00885/11171] [outer-loop] Handoff: off-policy RETIRED
 (confounded), point conductor straight to ON-POLICY

Off-policy is structurally confounded (truncation/style asymmetry: base verbose 37%,
trained-on-concise-p01 3%). Updated continuation: skip further off-policy, go to on-policy
(MiniCPM generates own traces -> shared verbosity -> no asymmetry), enforcing all 4
disciplines (headroom precheck, gold-control gate, truncation guard, multi-seed). Existing
harness is the starting point; add the on-policy generation step.

